bottomparticipants

actor Author
boundary "Profile Pag" as UI
boundary Router
control "DonationController" as Controller
entity "DonationService" as Service
entity ":DonationModel" as DonationModel
database MongoDB

Author -> UI : 1. Open Profile page
activate Author
activate UI
UI -> Router : 2. GET /api/donation/received
activate Router
Router -> Controller : 3. getReceivedGifts(req)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : 4. getReceivedGifts(userId)
activate Service
Service -> DonationModel : 5. find({ receiverId })\npopulate(sender, item)\nsort()
activate DonationModel

DonationModel -> MongoDB : 6. Execute query
activate MongoDB

MongoDB --> DonationModel : 7. documents
deactivate MongoDB

DonationModel --> Service : 8. donations
deactivate DonationModel
Service --> Controller : 9. result
deactivate Service

Controller --> Router : 10. HTTP response
deactivate Controller
Router --> UI : 11. received donation history
deactivate Router
UI -> Author : 12. Display received gifts list\n(or "No gifts yet")
deactivate UI
deactivate Author